## 2. Stage 0 for RDP audio: two new product-advisor tabs (foreground)

```bash
mkdir -p $O/brainstorm/rdp-audio $O/inbox
codex plugin list </dev/null | grep -F superpowers   # absent → operator poll to install; no Codex dispatch
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd $O/brainstorm/rdp-audio --label prod-codex --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-codex --kind codex --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd $O/brainstorm/rdp-audio --label prod-fable --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-fable --kind claude --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name prod-fable
```

